   "title": "CHRONIC → accelerated → BLAST crisis",
   "lines": [
    "• chronic phase: asymptomatic",
    "• fatigue, sweats, weight loss, splenomegaly",
    "• blast crisis acts like ACUTE leukemia"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cll_clue_0_0",
